OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 17 JAN
OL,4,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,5,     GArte dei Suonatori in an all-CPE
OL,6,     GBach programme from Poland's
OL,7,     GActus Humanus Festival, with
OL,8,     GMarcin Swiatkiewicz on the
OL,9,     Gharpsichord. Penny Gore presents.
OL,10,G0630FBreakfast
OL,11,     GHannah French presents Radio 3's
OL,12,     GBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,13,     Gemail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,14,G0900FSaturday Morning
OL,15,     GTom Service talks to composer
OL,16,     GBrett Dean and mezzo-soprano
OL,17,     GLotte Betts-Dean, and to
OL,18,     Gconductor Kazuki Yamada.
OL,19,G1200FEarlier... with Jools Holland
OL,20,     GJools is joined by actor Peter
OL,21,     GEyre with music by Sibelius,
OL,22,     GChopin and Nina Simone.
